#                                     Composition over mint.
#   (b) .split(ctx) -> [@song]      — REFUSED as name. `split` at peer
#                                     altitude is the prism-op slot
#                                     (shards/peer.mirror:78 `split
#                                     peer` per five-op prism
#                                     discipline); it names the
