#                                     temporal) — cognition-fanout is
#                                     THIRD-order, altitude-mismatch.
#   (c) .audhd(ctx) -> [@song]      — ACCEPTED per Alex 2026-07-17
#                                     delight-vector ratification.
#                                     Substrate-truthfully names the
#                                     diagnosis whose reverse-
#                                     engineering produced the
#                                     framework. Full AuDHD (not ADHD)
#                                     because BOTH attention modes are
